  "sourceConditions": [
    {
      "id": "problem",
      "condition": "다음 그림과 같이 $\\overline{\\text{AB}}=10$, $\\overline{\\text{AC}}=15$인 $\\triangle\\text{ABC}$에서 $\\angle\\text{A}$의 이등분선이 $\\overline{\\text{BC}}$와 만나는 점을 $\\text{D}$라 하자. $\\angle\\text{BAC}=60^\\circ$일 때, $\\overline{\\text{AD}}$의 길이는?",
      "mappedTo": "CURRENT_EXAM_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "id": "solution",
      "condition": "$\\triangle\\text{ABC} = \\triangle\\text{ABD} + \\triangle\\text{ACD}$이고 $\\angle\\text{BAD}=\\angle\\text{CAD}=30^\\circ$이므로 $$\\frac{1}{2} \\times 10 \\times 15 \\times \\sin 60^\\circ = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 10 \\times \\overline{\\text{AD}} \\times \\sin 30^\\circ + \\frac{1}{2} \\times 15 \\times \\overline{\\text{AD}} \\times \\sin 30^\\circ$$ $$\\frac{75\\sqrt{3}}{2} = \\frac{25}{4}\\overline{\\text{AD}} \\implies \\overline{\\text{AD}} = \\frac{75\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\times \\frac{4}{25} = 6\\sqrt{3}$$ 따라서 정답은 ⑤이다.",
      "mappedTo": "SOLUTION_AXIS"
    }
  ]
